          "create_time": 1793243889.323,
          "update_time": 1793243891.319,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The earlier carrier calculation clarifies what “independent” needs to mean here: its persistent lower bound was exactly the unknown first-jet margin. For the next approach, the bound must be derived without assuming that margin. An auxiliary flow could still help by making a signed relation in the complete theta source easier to estimate."
            ]
          },
          "status": "finished_successfully",
          "end_turn": false,
          "metadata": {
            "source": "Codex completed public message",
